https://git.kernel.org/cgit/linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux.git master


in testcase: will-it-scale
on test machine: 48 threads Intel(R) Xeon(R) CPU E5-2697 v2 @ 2.70GHz with =
112G memory
with following parameters:

	nr_task: 50%
	mode: thread
